    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund permanent, 24-hour police patrols to protect Muslim communities",
        "additional_details": "We believe the Muslim community needs a visible and permanent police presence that is on patrol 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.",
        "background": "In the face of a significant rise of anti-Muslim hate crime, we ask the Government to fund permanent 24-hour police patrols in communities with significant Muslim populations.",
